WEBVTT - State Space Search & Heuristics

00:00.000 --> 00:28.000
State space search visualizes problem solving as pathfinding through a directed graph of possibilities. Every move is a transition between nodes.

00:28.000 --> 00:58.000
Heuristic evaluation functions, denoted h(n), estimate remaining distance to the goal. When a heuristic is admissible, A* search guarantees finding the optimal path while exploring minimal states.

00:58.000 --> 01:25.000
MindEase turns these mathematical search trees into visual diagrams, removing symbolic parsing friction for visual and neurodivergent learners.
